  {
    "id": 2009019110100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あと、この前プロデューサーさんのお迎えを待ってる時に\r\n中古CDショップに入ってみたんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ、珍しいな\r\n最近は配信が主流なのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なんか気になって！\r\nそしたら、あたしたちのCDを買ってくれた人がいて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00462",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "se": "0454",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200,
    "bgEffectTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "デビュー曲！　でしたー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……！\r\n結構経つのに、現物を手に取ってくれる人がいるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい……っ\r\nその人、たまたま放クラを見つけたみたいだったんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしその時に、\r\n時間を飛び越えて届くこともあるんだって思って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110140"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今のあたしが頑張ることもだけど……────",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "昔のあたしが頑張ったことが誰かに届いて、\r\nその人を笑顔にできたり、助けたりできるのかもって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それって、スッゴいことだなって思ったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0454",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だって\r\nあたしがいつかアイドルを辞めちゃっても",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "放クラは、ずっとずっとずーっと誰かに届くんです！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009019110200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それって、ずーっと誰かの好きを守ったり、\r\n誰かを助けたりできるかもしれないってことですよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901911/2009019110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、そうだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
